Subject: [PATCH 2/2] test(execution-engine): cover the Docker log demuxer

Add a vitest suite for demuxDockerStream built from synthetic framed buffers
(no Docker needed): header stripping, stdout/stderr separation, multi-frame
concatenation, multi-byte UTF-8, the raw/TTY fallback, and truncated trailing
frames. Wire up the package 'test' script (vitest run) to match apps/web.

Signed-off-by: BRIANB <124537281+ba-00001@users.noreply.github.com>
